{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0104-s001", "text": "Studentexamen ordnas två gånger per år, varje vår och höst.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-gymnasium/narration/resume-20261103T015031489940+0000-4/hb-c08-u0104-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.50312925170068, "peak": 0.298492431640625, "generation_seconds": 8.989813663065434, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0104-s002", "text": "När en studerande avlägger studentexamen ska hen avlägga åtminstone fem prov.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-gymnasium/narration/resume-20261103T015031489940+0000-4/hb-c08-u0104-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.896326530612245, "peak": 0.30712890625, "generation_seconds": 11.42573334206827, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0104-s003", "text": "Det går också att avlägga fler.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-gymnasium/narration/resume-20261103T015031489940+0000-4/hb-c08-u0104-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.0650340136054424, "peak": 0.261566162109375, "generation_seconds": 5.68760684505105, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0105-s001", "text": "För studentexamensproven får den studerande vitsord med bokstäver som härstammar från latinska vitsord.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-gymnasium/narration/resume-20261103T015031489940+0000-4/hb-c08-u0105-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.195102040816327, "peak": 0.291473388671875, "generation_seconds": 14.283423047978431, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0105-s002", "text": "Bokstäverna från det högsta vitsordet till det lägsta är ell, e, emm, se, be och a och i för underkänt.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-gymnasium/narration/resume-20261103T015031489940+0000-4/hb-c08-u0105-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.777142857142858, "peak": 0.29534912109375, "generation_seconds": 12.86099523701705, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0105-s003", "text": "Den studerande får ett studentexamensbetyg när hen har avlagt gymnasiets hela lärokurs och dessutom studentexamensproven.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-gymnasium/narration/resume-20261103T015031489940+0000-4/hb-c08-u0105-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.24, "peak": 0.340576171875, "generation_seconds": 16.59127688105218, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0106-s001", "text": "På gymnasiet finns inga terminsavgifter.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-gymnasium/narration/resume-20261103T015031489940+0000-4/hb-c08-u0106-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.6919727891156464, "peak": 0.252685546875, "generation_seconds": 7.216590645024553, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0106-s002", "text": "Utbildningen är alltså gratis.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-gymnasium/narration/resume-20261103T015031489940+0000-4/hb-c08-u0106-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.0650340136054424, "peak": 0.377166748046875, "generation_seconds": 6.069186058128253, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
